OL,3,GNEWSA'People wearing trousers and
OL,4,Aboring shoes are the weird ones'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTop hats, waistcoats, an array of
OL,7,Fpocket watches and jewellery - uphill
OL,8,FLincoln has been plunged into a quirky
OL,9,FNeo-Victorian world for its annual
OL,10,Fsteampunk festival.
OL,12,FRun annually over the August Bank
OL,13,FHoliday weekend, the four-day event
OL,14,Fblends science fiction with reimagined
OL,15,FVictorian fashion and technology, and
OL,16,Fis held mostly within the backdrop of
OL,17,FLincoln Castle and Cathedral.
OL,19,FLincoln Steampunk Festival is thought
OL,20,Fto be the largest and longest-running
OL,21,Fsteampunk event in the world.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
