OL,3,GNEWSA'People wearing trousers and
OL,4,Aboring shoes are the weird ones'
OL,5,
OL,6,FKate Smith, 36, who has travelled from
OL,7,FCambridge for the event with her mum,
OL,8,Fsaid: "I love the fact you can be
OL,9,Fcreative and do anything with
OL,10,Fsteampunk. So long as you're being
OL,11,Fsplendid, everything is accepted."
